ding:11px 22px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--mlc-accent);color:#1a1228;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--mlc-accent);transition:filter .15s}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);color:#1a1228}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-btns{flex:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-btn-2{background:transparent;color:var(--mlc-accent-text)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-btn-2:hover{background:var(--mlc-card);color:var(--mlc-accent-text)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-note{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mlc-mfg)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-bullets{margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--mlc-mfg)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-bullets li{margin:0 0 10px}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-bullets strong{color:var(--mlc-fg)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-stay,.mlc-wrap .mlc-switch{margin-top:36px}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-stay{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--mlc-border);border-radius:14px;background:var(--mlc-card)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-move-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin:18px 0 4px}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-move-grid>div{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--mlc-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--mlc-card)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-move-title{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1rem}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-also{margin-top:22px;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--mlc-mfg)}\n.mlc-wrap .mlc-panel-hero{margin-top:8px}\n.mlc-wrap a:focus-visible,.mlc-wrap summary:focus-visible,.mlc-wrap .mlc-scroll:focus-visible,.mlc-wrap .mlc-pre:focus-visible,.mlc-wrap .mlc-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--mlc-accent);outline-offset:2px}\n@container (max-width:720px){.mlc-wrap .mlc-codes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mlc-wrap .mlc-cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:20px}}\n@container (max-width:640px){.mlc-wrap .mlc-move-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.mlc-wrap .mlc-stay{padding:18px}}\n@container (max-width:560px){.mlc-wrap .mlc-table{min-width:0;font-size:.9rem}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table thead{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table,.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody,.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tr,.mlc-wrap .mlc-table th,.mlc-wrap .mlc-table td{display:block;width:auto}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody tr{border-bottom:1px solid var(--mlc-border);padding:12px 14px}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody tr:last-child{border-bottom:0}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody th{width:auto;padding:0 0 8px;border:0;font-weight:600;color:var(--mlc-fg)}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody td{width:auto;padding:8px 10px;border:0;border-radius:6px}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody td+td{margin-top:6px;background:var(--mlc-muted)}.mlc-wrap .mlc-table tbody td::before{content:attr(data-mlc-label);display:block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mlc-mfg);margin-bottom:2px}.mlc-wrap .mlc-pre{font-size:.74rem;padding:14px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"mlc-head\"><p class=\"mlc-kicker\">MediaLit vs UploadThing</p><h1 class=\"mlc-h2\">Private files, agents and self-hosting tip the scale.</h1><p class=\"mlc-lead\">UploadThing made file uploads pleasant for a lot of TypeScript developers. If you're on Next.js and happy with its file routers, you probably don't need to switch. People usually look around when they want private files without paying, a way out of the hosted service, or somewhere AI agents can save files.</p><div class=\"mlc-eyebrow-note\">Pricing checked 6 November 2026. Includes where UploadThing is stronger.</div></div>\n<section class=\"mlc-panel mlc-panel-hero\" id=\"mlc-panel-uploadthing\"><h2 class=\"mlc-h3\">Side by side</h2><p class=\"mlc-intro\">Both start free and offer a paid plan with 100 GB. MediaLit includes private files on Free, ships a hosted MCP server and CLI, and is fully self-hostable. UploadThing has a bigger free tier (2 GB), typed file routers, and a clear usage-based path past 100 GB.</p><a class=\"mlc-article\" href=\"/blog/medialit-vs-uploadthing\">Read the longer write-up <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n<div class=\"mlc-table-card\"><div class=\"mlc-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"MediaLit and UploadThing comparison table\"><table class=\"mlc-table\"><caption class=\"mlc-sr\">MediaLit compared with UploadThing</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"mlc-col-ml\">MediaLit</th><th scope=\"col\">UploadThing</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Signup required</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">Yes, free account</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">Yes</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Free plan</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">Basic: 1 GB storage, 50 MB max file, unlimited uploads and downloads</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">2 GB storage shared across all apps, unlimited uploads and downloads</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Paid plan price</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">Pro: $10/mo or $100/yr for 100 GB storage and a 2 GB max file (<a href=\"/#pricing\">see current pricing</a>)</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">$10/mo for 100 GB (Private Files + regions). Usage-based from $25/mo for 250 GB, then $0.08/GB</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Max file size</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">50 MB (Basic), 2 GB (Pro)</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><span class=\"mlc-chip\">Unclear</span><span>Set per file route (defaults: 4 MB images, 16 MB video). Plan-level cap: Unclear</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Setup time (est.)</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">~5 min</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">~5 to 10 min</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Lines of code (upload a file, get a URL)</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">7 lines</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">10 lines</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">SDK needed</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">No. REST API, or the optional <code>medialit</code> Node SDK</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">Recommended (<code>uploadthing</code>). A REST API is documented</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Presigned / browser uploads</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-y\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Yes: </span>Yes. Short-lived upload signatures; browser uploads are resumable (tus)</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-y\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Yes: </span>Yes. File routes with ready-made upload components</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Signed private URLs</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-y\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Yes: </span>Yes on every plan, including Free. Private by default until you make a file public</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-p\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Partly: </span>Paid plans only (100GB App and Usage Based). <code>generateSignedURL</code> up to 7 days</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">CDN included</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-y\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Yes: </span>Yes. Delivery through a CDN</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><span class=\"mlc-chip\">Unclear</span><span>Not stated on the pricing page</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Egress / bandwidth</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\">Unlimited uploads and downloads listed. No separate egress rate published</td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\">Unlimited uploads and downloads listed. No separate egress rate published</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Image / video processing</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-p\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Partly: </span>Thumbnails on upload, optional WebP conversion</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-n\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l7 7M11.5 4.5l-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">No: </span>None built in. Docs suggest resizing before upload</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">AI-agent access</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-y\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Yes: </span>Hosted MCP with OAuth, plus the <code>medialit</code> CLI</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-p\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Partly: </span>Canary <code>@uploadthing/mcp-server</code> from an open draft PR. No official CLI found</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Open source / self-host</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-y\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Yes: </span>Yes. AGPL server, MIT clients, self-hostable on any S3-compatible storage</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-p\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">Partly: </span>SDK is MIT. Storage service is hosted only</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">File versioning / overwrite</th><td data-mlc-label=\"MediaLit\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-n\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l7 7M11.5 4.5l-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">No: </span>No versioning. Upload a new file and delete the old one</span></span></td><td data-mlc-label=\"UploadThing\"><span class=\"mlc-cell\"><svg class=\"mlc-ic mlc-ic-n\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 4.5l7 7M11.5 4.5l-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><span class=\"mlc-sr\">No: </span>No. Overwrite/dedupe request open since April 2024</span></span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"mlc-note\">Sources: <a href=\"https://uploadthing.com/pricing\">UploadThing pricing</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.uploadthing.com/file-routes\">file routes</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.uploadthing.com/regions-and-acl\">regions and ACL</a>, <a href=\"https://medialit.cloud/#pricing\">MediaLit pricing</a>. USD, checked 6 November 2026. Cells marked Unclear are not documented on the public pricing page.</p>\n<h4 class=\"mlc-h4\">Upload a file and get a URL</h4>\n<div class=\"mlc-codes\">\n<figure class=\"mlc-code\"><figcaption class=\"mlc-code-head\"><span>MediaLit</span><span class=\"mlc-chip\">Node.js</span></figcaption><pre class=\"mlc-pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>import { MediaLit } from &quot;medialit&quot;;\n\nconst medialit = new MediaLit(); // reads MEDIALIT_API_KEY\nconst { mediaId } = await medialit.upload(&quot;./photo.jpg&quot;, {\n  access: &quot;public&quot;,\n});\nconst media = await medialit.seal(mediaId); // keep it\nconsole.log(media.file);</code></pre><p class=\"mlc-code-note\">Works from any backend. Browser uploads use a short-lived signature from your server.</p></figure>\n<figure class=\"mlc-code\"><figcaption class=\"mlc-code-head\"><span>UploadThing</span><span class=\"mlc-chip\">Node.js</span></figcaption><pre class=\"mlc-pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>import { readFile } from &quot;node:fs/promises&quot;;\nimport { UTApi, UTFile } from &quot;uploadthing/server&quot;;\n\nconst utapi = new UTApi(); // reads UPLOADTHING_TOKEN\nconst file = new UTFile(\n  [await readFile(&quot;./photo.jpg&quot;)],\n  &quot;photo.jpg&quot;,\n);\nconst { data, error } = await utapi.uploadFiles(file);\nif (error) throw new Error(error.message);\nconsole.log(data.ufsUrl);</code></pre><p class=\"mlc-code-note\">Server-side upload via <code>UTApi</code>. Most apps use file routes and <code>&lt;UploadButton&gt;</code> instead.</p></figure>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"mlc-h4\">Questions</h4>\n<div class=\"mlc-faq\">\n<details class=\"mlc-faq-item\"><summary>Is MediaLit cheaper than UploadThing?</summary><p>Both offer a 100 GB paid tier. MediaLit Pro is $10/mo or $100/yr. The bigger differences are private files on MediaLit's free plan, self-hosting, and agent access. <a href=\"/#pricing\">See MediaLit pricing</a>.</p></details>\n<details class=\"mlc-faq-item\"><summary>Can I self-host either?</summary><p>MediaLit yes: the code behind medialit.cloud is the same code you can run on your own S3-compatible storage. UploadThing's SDK is open source, but the storage service is hosted only.</p></details>\n<details class=\"mlc-faq-item\"><summary>Does MediaLit work outside Next.js?</summary><p>Yes. REST API, Node SDK, React component and a framework-free uploader. UploadThing is strongest in TypeScript/Next.js stacks.</p></details>\n<details class=\"mlc-faq-item\"><summary>How do AI agents use MediaLit?</summary><p>Assistants connect to the hosted MCP server with OAuth. Coding agents use the CLI. MCP uploads are limited to about 1.5 MB per file; larger files go through the CLI or API.</p></details>\n</div>\n<section class=\"mlc-panel mlc-stay\" id=\"mlc-stick-with-uploadthing\"><h2 class=\"mlc-h3\">Stick with UploadThing if…</h2><p class=\"mlc-intro\">We'd rather you pick the right tool than migrate twice. UploadThing wins in clear cases:</p>\n<ul class=\"mlc-bullets\">\n<li><strong>You're all-in on Next.js or a typed TypeScript stack.</strong> File routers and the upload components are very tidy end to end.</li>\n<li><strong>2 GB free covers you and you don't need private files yet.</strong> UploadThing's free tier is larger than MediaLit's 1 GB.</li>\n<li><strong>You expect to grow past 100 GB on a hosted service.</strong> Usage Based starts at $25/mo for 250 GB, then $0.08/GB. MediaLit Pro tops out at 100 GB hosted (self-host for more).</li>\n<li><strong>Your team already likes the UploadThing DX.</strong> Switching storage for its own sake rarely pays off.</li>\n</ul></section>\n<section class=\"mlc-panel mlc-switch\" id=\"mlc-switch-to-medialit-uploadthing\"><h2 class=\"mlc-h3\">What moves with you, and what stays</h2><p class=\"mlc-intro\">Add a signature route, swap the upload button, seal uploads on save, then move existing files with the CLI or SDK.</p>\n<div class=\"mlc-move-grid\"><div><h3 class=\"mlc-move-title\">Moves with you</h3><ul class=\"mlc-bullets\"><li>Existing files (re-upload; store <code>mediaId</code>)</li><li>Public and private access</li><li>Your auth check around the signature endpoint</li><li>The option to self-host later without rewriting uploads</li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"mlc-move-title\">Stays on UploadThing</h3><ul class=\"mlc-bullets\"><li>Typed file-router definitions</li><li><code>&lt;UploadButton&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;UploadDropzone&gt;</code> components</li><li>Usage-based hosted scaling past 100 GB</li><li>Hard-to-guess public URLs as the default ACL</li></ul></div></div>\n<p class=\"mlc-note\">Store the <code>mediaId</code>, because public URLs change when a file is sealed and private URLs are generated fresh each time. <a href=\"https://medialit.cloud/docs/introduction\">MediaLit docs</a>.</p></section>\n<div class=\"mlc-cta\"><div><p class=\"mlc-cta-title\">Try MediaLit</p><p class=\"mlc-cta-text\">Start free. Pro adds 100 GB and 2 GB uploads for $10/mo or $100/yr, with private files and MCP from day one. <a href=\"/#pricing\">See current pricing</a>.</p></div><div class=\"mlc-btns\"><a class=\"mlc-btn\" href=\"https://app.medialit.cloud/login\">Start free</a><a class=\"mlc-btn mlc-btn-2\" href=\"/#pricing\">See pricing</a></div></div>\n</section>\n<p class=\"mlc-also\">Also comparing? <a href=\"/compare\">All MediaLit comparisons</a> · <a href=\"/compare-cloudinary\">MediaLit vs Cloudinary</a> · <a href=\"/blog/medialit-vs-uploadthing\">Longer write-up</a></p>\n<p class=\"mlc-foot\">Prices and limits checked 6 November 2026 from <a href=\"https://uploadthing.com/pricing\">UploadThing</a> and <a href=\"https://medialit.cloud/#pricing\">MediaLit</a>. Setup time is an estimate. Lines of code are counted from the samples above. Spotted something out of date? <a href=\"https://github.com/codelitdev/medialit/issues\">Open an issue</a>.</p>\n</div>"
      }
    }
  ]
